{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33600","headline":"献独孤尚书 · 许棠","name":"献独孤尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虚抛南楚滞西秦，白首依前衣白身。\n退鷁已经三十载，登龙曾见一千人。\n魂离爲役诗篇苦，泪竭缘嗟骨相贫。\n今日鞠躬高斾下，欲倾肝胆杳无因。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}